# Dependencies & local artifacts
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/node_modules
remotion-composer/node_modules/
.playwright-cli/
/.brains/
/.opencode/
# Generated local verification fixtures/cache/evidence, not product source; retain on disk.
/.quality-run/
*.temp
*.log
*.tgz

# Binaries
*.exe
*.test
build/
bin/facet-*
bin/facet
!bin/*.js
# Windows resource objects scripts/package-release.py generates for a build.
cmd/facet/rsrc_windows_*.syso

# Scratch probes from coordinating sessions. Several sessions can work in this
# tree at once, and `git add -A` cannot tell a peer's temporary file from one's
# own. The prefix is the convention peers are asked to use for throwaway files,
# so a capture is impossible rather than merely unlikely.
zz_*_test.go
zz_*.go

# Build output (bundle packaging, composer test builds) and Python caches.
/dist/
/remotion-composer/dist/
__pycache__/

# Session scaffolding prompts. Local working notes for whoever is driving a
# session; not product source and not reproducible from it. Ignored rather
# than deleted so a session can keep its own context without that context
# becoming a tracked artifact someone later mistakes for documentation.
/SESSION_PROMPT.md
/STARTER_PROMPT.md
